flowchart TD
    Start([WorkerRunner::run]) --> Step1[1. GrokRunner::new(config)]
    Step1 --> SpawnGrok[tokio::spawn runner.run<br/>spawn grok agent serve<br/>* exit 시 restart_delay_secs 후 재시작 최대 10회]
    Step1 --> Step2[2. RegistrationClient::register_with_retry]
    Step2 --> RegisterAPI[POST /v1/workers/register<br/>5초 간격 무한 재시도<br/>-> worker_id, heartbeat_interval_secs 획득]
    RegisterAPI --> Step3[3. tokio::spawn run_heartbeat_loop]
    Step3 --> HeartbeatLoop[주기마다 반복:<br/>• TCP health_check 1초 타임아웃<br/>• sysinfo 메트릭 수집<br/>• POST /v1/workers/heartbeat]
    RegisterAPI --> Step4[4. wait_for_signal SIGINT/SIGTERM]
    Step4 --> Shutdown[shutdown_tx 및 grok_shutdown_tx 송신]
    Shutdown --> Cleanup[• grok 서브프로세스 SIGTERM 5s timeout -> SIGKILL<br/>• heartbeat 루프 종료<br/>• POST DELETE /v1/workers/:id best-effort deregister]
